Layer	    Tech 
Language  TypeScript
UI         React 19
Framework  Next.js 16 (App Router)
Styling    Tailwind CSS 4 + shadcn/ui (Base UI)
Icons      lucide-react
Database   PostgreSQL via pg (in-memory fallback locally)
Auth       Custom email/password + HTTP-only session cookie
Payments
UPI QR (upi://pay link)
App structure (where code lives)

sisora/
  src/app/           → pages + API routes
  src/components/    → UI (hero, shop, cart, owner panel…)
  src/lib/           → products, auth, orders, UPI, DB
  migrations/        → SQL tables
  public/            → static files (e.g. upi-qr.png)
Key APIs
/api/auth/* — register, login, logout, me
/api/products — shop catalog
/api/orders — place/view orders + UPI QR
/api/admin/* — owner products, orders, UPI settings
Run

cd sisora
npm install
npm run dev
Open http://localhost:3847
